** Test file for semantic tokens **

NAME STREAM1    ,TEST STREAM ,ONE         ,FIRST       /*
     STREAM2    ,TEST STREAM ,TWO         ,SECOND      /*

$ UNIT OPERATIONS
FLASH UID=TEST1, NAME=TEST UNIT
  FEED STREAM1, STREAM2
  PRODUCT M=STREAM1

PROP STRM=STREAM1, TEMP=25
PROP STRM=STREAM2, PRES=1.0